{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Baller</strong> is a fast-paced, online multiplayer sports brawler where physics, chaos, and skill collide. Roll into the arena as a highly maneuverable, round-bodied competitor, and face off in intense team-based matches where the objective is simple: hit the ball, score goals, and outplay your opponents.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Gameplay</strong>: You are the player <i>and</i> the weapon. Slam, spin, and bounce your way across the field to smash the ball into the opposing team\u2019s goal.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Team-Based Matches</strong>: Battle it out in without a limit on how many players can play the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics-Driven Mayhem</strong>: Every bump, hit, and ricochet is powered by dynamic physics, creating endlessly varied and unpredictable gameplay moments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Casual</strong>: If you are just looking to have fun, Baller has a way to get to you.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to roll? Get in the arena, master the bounce, and become the ultimate <strong>Baller</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DEV ROUTE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Current state, while still highly in alpha, only developing functions.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923120/extras/9a2e779ad508e9f8e06c6664f713dcbe.avif?t=1758701771\" alt=\"Alpha, still developing functions. Players while playing Baller with the ball present.\" width=1600 height=750 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3923120?t=1758701771","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackgroun